# See https://help.github.com/articles/ignoring-files/ for more about ignoring files.

# dependencies
/node_modules
workers/*/node_modules
/.pnp
.pnp.*
.yarn/*
!.yarn/patches
!.yarn/plugins
!.yarn/releases
!.yarn/versions

# testing
/coverage
/playwright-report
/test-results
test-results.json

# next.js
/.next/
/out/

# production
/build

# misc
.DS_Store
*.pem
__pycache__/

# debug
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.pnpm-debug.log*

# env files (can opt-in for committing if needed)
.env*
!.env.test

# vercel
.vercel

# typescript
*.tsbuildinfo
next-env.d.ts
tests/reports/*.md

# Native apps (separate git repository)
apps/

# Docs assets (large binary files kept locally)
docs/assets/
docs/nanogen_images/

# Temporary/one-off scripts (dev-only, not for commit)
scripts/tmp/

# Claude Code symlinks (managed in claude-code-template repository)
# Ignore all, then whitelist MUED-specific files
.claude/projects/
.claude/commands/
.claude/agents/*
!.claude/agents/database-architect.md
!.claude/agents/mued-architect-manager.md
!.claude/agents/script-consolidator.md
# ★Two kinds of skill live under .claude/skills, and only one of them is safe to ignore:
#   - SYMLINKS into claude-code-template — the real file is tracked and pushed there, so ignoring
#     the link here is correct and the skill survives losing this working copy.
#   - REAL DIRECTORIES authored for mued and existing nowhere else. Ignoring one of those means it
#     has no clone, no backup and no recovery path; it lives on one disk.
# ★So the allowlist below is not decoration — a mued-authored skill that is missing from it is
#   invisible to git and unrecoverable. Audit (2026-08-29) found three in exactly that state
#   (web-performance, mued-onboarding, legal-compliance — 43 KB, two of them named in CLAUDE.md),
#   and `git status` reported the repo clean the whole time, because ignored files are not untracked.
# ★When adding a mued-authored skill, add its line here in the same commit.
.claude/skills/*
# ★The manifest that scripts/verify/skill-durability.ts reads. It was itself swallowed by the glob
#   on first write — the list of what is protected was not protected. Keep this line above the rest.
!.claude/skills/DISTRIBUTED.txt
!.claude/skills/ai-models/
!.claude/skills/aio-seo/
!.claude/skills/database/
!.claude/skills/daw-osc/
!.claude/skills/legal-compliance/
!.claude/skills/mued-onboarding/
!.claude/skills/muedial-api/
!.claude/skills/threads-insight/
!.claude/skills/video-branding/
!.claude/skills/web-performance/

# Large binary files
*.ipa

# Remotion video projects (separate repository)
/videos/

# Playwright onboarding recordings
/recordings/

docs/sunogen_audio/
docs/drafts/
docs/engineering/
docs/monetization/

# Claude Code session memory (stored in project root, not committed)
/memory/

# collector 出力 (aggregate-plugin-funnel-daily.ts・件数のみ PII-free だが git には入れない)
/reports/
